Malayalam–Tamil Song Lyrics Translation Project
🚀 Project Overview
This project extracts, aligns, analyzes, and translates Malayalam song lyrics into Tamil using a neural translation model (mBART). It includes the following major components:

✅ Extract song pairs from a ZIP archive
✅ Analyze phonetic syllables, rhyme, and word boundaries
✅ Tokenize text using mBART tokenizer
✅ Train and evaluate a translation model using K-Fold cross-validation
✅ Compute BLEU and TER metrics
✅ Provide an interface for users to input Malayalam text files and get Tamil translations

