💡 How It Works
1️⃣ ZIP Extraction:
Unzips a folder containing paired malayalam.txt and tamil.txt files for each song.

2️⃣ Alignment:
Aligns the Malayalam and Tamil lines, ensuring both are paired by index for model training.

3️⃣ Phonetic & Rhyme Feature Extraction:

Splits Malayalam and Tamil words into syllables using regex.

Extracts rhyme schemes from last syllables.

Marks word boundaries for rhythm and linguistic analysis.

4️⃣ Translation Preparation:
Uses the mBART50 tokenizer to prepare text for training.

5️⃣ Training & Evaluation:

Trains the facebook/mbart-large-50-many-to-many-mmt model on the aligned lyrics.

Uses 3-fold cross-validation.

Evaluates with BLEU and TER metrics to assess translation quality.

6️⃣ User Translation Tool:
Allows the user to input any Malayalam lyrics .txt file and outputs a Tamil translation to translated_tamil_lyrics2.txt.
